{"id":"64a383191f67c404","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Forcing5 Quotient Boolean Algebra","display":"df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Forcing5 Quotient Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Forcing5 Quotient Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[58-df-quotient]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing5-quotient-boolean-algebra — ZFC Forcing5 Quotient Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"58-df-quotient\">58-df-quotient</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,Q,U,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\">\\(B,Q,U,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq B\">\\(U\\subseteq B\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"58-df-quotient\">58-df-quotient</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqClass}:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{EqClass}:V^3\\to V\\)</span> is the equivalence-class operator defined here, with order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,B,R)\">\\((a,B,R)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(U,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\subseteq B\\land0\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\n(b\\in U\\land a\\wedge b=a\\to a\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\vee b\\in U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(U,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\subseteq B\\land0\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\n(b\\in U\\land a\\wedge b=a\\to a\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\vee b\\in U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in B:\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in B:\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(Q,B,U,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\n\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(U,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists R_U,\\wedge_Q,\\vee_Q,\\neg_Q,0_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_U=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in B\\times B:\n(a\\wedge\\neg b)\\vee(b\\wedge\\neg a)\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,B,R_U)\n\\land0_Q=\\operatorname{EqClass}(0,B,R_U)\\land1_Q=\\operatorname{EqClass}(1,B,R_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R_U)\\wedge_Q\\operatorname{EqClass}(b,B,R_U)=\\operatorname{EqClass}(a\\wedge b,B,R_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R_U)\\vee_Q\\operatorname{EqClass}(b,B,R_U)=\\operatorname{EqClass}(a\\vee b,B,R_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\neg_Q\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R_U)=\\operatorname{EqClass}(\\neg a,B,R_U)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(Q,\\wedge_Q,\\vee_Q,\\neg_Q,0_Q,1_Q)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5QuotientBooleanAlgebra}_S(Q,B,U,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\n\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(U,B,\\wedge,\\vee,0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists R_U,\\wedge_Q,\\vee_Q,\\neg_Q,0_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_U=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in B\\times B:\n(a\\wedge\\neg b)\\vee(b\\wedge\\neg a)\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,B,R_U)\n\\land0_Q=\\operatorname{EqClass}(0,B,R_U)\\land1_Q=\\operatorname{EqClass}(1,B,R_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R_U)\\wedge_Q\\operatorname{EqClass}(b,B,R_U)=\\operatorname{EqClass}(a\\wedge b,B,R_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R_U)\\vee_Q\\operatorname{EqClass}(b,B,R_U)=\\operatorname{EqClass}(a\\vee b,B,R_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\neg_Q\\operatorname{EqClass}(a,B,R_U)=\\operatorname{EqClass}(\\neg a,B,R_U)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(Q,\\wedge_Q,\\vee_Q,\\neg_Q,0_Q,1_Q)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideal induces the congruence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\sim_Ub\">\\(a\\sim_Ub\\)</span> exactly when their Boolean symmetric difference lies in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>; equivalence classes are locally defined bounded sets rather than an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a]_R\">\\([a]_R\\)</span> operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","stat